@* Paper waiting for its music: faint staves, with a light sweeping across them that moves by transform alone. A sheet has it
   for a whole piece (the stylesheet shows it while the sheet's script says nothing is drawn yet, or more is coming), and a
   PDF's frame until its first page is drawn. *@
<div class="sheet-wait" aria-hidden="true">
    @for (var i = 0; i < 6; i++)
    {
        <span class="sheet-wait-system"></span>
    }
    <span class="sheet-wait-sweep"></span>
</div>
